### ==========================================
### E2E SCENARIO: Orders, Stock, and Wallets
### ==========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### ------------------------------------------
### PHASE 1: DATABASE SEEDING
### ------------------------------------------

### 1a. Register a Seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller@unknowns.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Seller"
}

### 1b. Register a Buyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@unknowns.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Buyer"
}

### 1c. Login Seller (Captures Token Automatically!)
# @name loginSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller@unknowns.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 1d. Login Buyer (Captures Token Automatically!)
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@unknowns.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Assign captured tokens to variables
@sellerToken = {{loginSeller.response.body.data.token}}
@buyerToken = {{loginBuyer.response.body.data.token}}

### ------------------------------------------
### PHASE 2: INVENTORY & WALLET SETUP
### ------------------------------------------

### 2a. Seller Creates Product 1 (Laptop)
# @name createProduct1
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 1000,
  "stock": 5
}

### 2b. Seller Creates Product 2 (Mouse)
# @name createProduct2
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Logitech MX Master 3",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 10
}

### Extract the created product IDs
@product1 = {{createProduct1.response.body.data.id}}
@product2 = {{createProduct2.response.body.data.id}}

### 2c. Buyer Deposits Funds ($2,500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e2e-deposit-001

{
  "amount": 2500,
  "description": "Initial account funding"
}

### ------------------------------------------
### PHASE 3: THE HAPPY PATH (CHECKOUT)
### ------------------------------------------

### 3a. Buyer Places an Order (1 Laptop, 2 Mice = $1200)
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e2e-order-001

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{createProduct1.response.body.data.id}}, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": {{createProduct2.response.body.data.id}}, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Extract the created Order ID
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.data.id}}

### 3b. Verify Wallet Balance (Should be $1300 remaining)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 3c. Verify Product Stock (Laptop should be 4, Mouse should be 8)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 3d. Get Buyer's Order History
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}


### ------------------------------------------
### PHASE 4: REVERSAL & CANCELLATION
### ------------------------------------------

### 4a. Cancel the Order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e2e-cancel-001

### 4b. Verify Wallet Balance Refunded (Should be back to $2500)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}


### ------------------------------------------
### PHASE 5: SECURITY & VULNERABILITY CHECKS
### ------------------------------------------

### 5a. Exploit Attempt: Negative Quantities (Should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e2e-hack-001

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{product1}}, "quantity": -5 }
  ]
}

### 5b. Exploit Attempt: Insufficient Funds (Try to buy 5 Laptops = $5000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e2e-hack-002

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{product1}}, "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### 5c. Exploit Attempt: Out of Stock Constraint (Try to buy 20 Mice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e2e-hack-003

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{product2}}, "quantity": 20 }
  ]
}